# Trivy CVE allowlist — Phase 12 WP 3.8
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, optional comment after `#`.
# Every entry MUST include:
#   - WHY accepted (transient dep, no exploit path, business decision)
#   - WHEN to re-evaluate (target date or release)
#   - WHO approved (PR author or security review)
#
# Audit: `npm run gate:supply-chain` (gate test asserts every entry has
# justification + expiry not in the past).
#
# Example (none yet — repo starts clean):
#
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # JustifiedRisk: transitive via foo@1.2.3; no exploit path
#                 # in our usage (we don't call the vulnerable API).
#                 # Re-evaluate: 2026-08-01 when foo@2.0 ships fix.
#                 # Approved-by: zdenbe @ 2026-05-20
